source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The span body consumes the backslash before `(` and `)`, which is how an emoticon token is defused inside code.
-- input.jira --
{{a\(b\)}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a&#40;b&#41;</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a(b)`
-- warnings.json --
[]
